{"ref":"BDB, מִשְׁעֶ֫נֶת","hw":"מִשְׁעֶ֫נֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁעֶ֫נֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. staff</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:21\" href=\"/Judges.6.21\">Ju 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.31\">2 K 4:31</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.21\">2 K 18:21</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁעַנְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:19\" href=\"/Exodus.21.19\">Ex 21:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.4\">Zc 8:4</a>, etc.; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁעֲנֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a>;—<em>staff</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:19\" href=\"/Exodus.21.19\">Ex 21:19</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:21\" href=\"/Judges.6.21\">Ju 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.29\">2 K 4:29</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.4\">Zc 8:4</a>; fig. of political support, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁעֶנֶת הַקָּנֶה הָרָצוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.21\">2 K 18:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.6\">Is 36:6</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.6\">Ez 29:6</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> as shepherd <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:4\" href=\"/Psalms.23.4\">ψ 23:4</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט</span>).","next":"BDB, שָׁעַע","prev":"BDB, מַשְׁעֵנָה"}